## Limits

Each run stops with `limit_exceeded` after {{limits.max_steps}} model calls, {{limits.max_tool_calls}}
tool calls, {{limits.max_tokens}} tokens or ${{limits.max_cost_usd}}, and with `timeout` after
{{limits.timeout_s}} seconds.

## HTTP API

The server speaks ARC v1: `GET /health`, `GET /manifest`, `POST /runs/wait`,
`POST /runs/stream` (server-sent AG-UI events), `GET /runs/{id}`,
`POST /runs/{id}/resume` for approvals, and `GET`/`DELETE /threads/{id}`.

```bash
curl -s localhost:8000/runs/wait -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{"input": "hello"}'
```
